          ],
          "description": "fuelFormulation.BioDieselEsterVolume, volume percent ester. NULL in 2,118 of 2,158 rows -- every formulation that is not a biodiesel blend -- so this is the column that makes `fuel_property_or_zero` necessary rather than decorative.",
          "update": {
