            "complexmodelparameters_rows"
          ],
          "description": "complexModelParameters.coeff2. The three are SUMMED, not alternatives: `criteria.rs:639` adds all three and reading `coeff1` alone leaves CO wrong by 5.6e-03. NULL in most rows, hence NaN, so each is swept by `fuel_property_or_zero` before the sum.",
          "update": {
            "kind": "data",
            "source": "db_complexmodelparameters",
            "from": {
