          "description": "meanFuelParameters.stdDevValue. NULL means NO STANDARDISING, which is 1 and not 0 -- a different null from the column beside it. Every CO row is NULL here and none is NULL in `centeringValue`. NOTE the shipped `complexModelParameterName.cmpExpression` text OMITS this division even where the value is not 1, so the table's own expression is incomplete relative to what MOVES computes; `criteria.rs` applies it and so does this document.",
          "update": {
