          "description": "setup.rs:411's clamp(0, 1), which makes it exactly 0 in every run this document has been asked for -- in each of `expand-counties`' three counties as well, so the non-zero A/C arm still has no fixture (§23). Written out rather than factored into a `clamp01` template, because §4.8 argues the VALUE each of this chain's two clamps takes is the load-bearing fact and a shared template would hide which is which."
        },
