            "drive_schedule_assoc_rows",
            "operating_mode_rows",
            "physicsrow_rows"
          ],
          "description": "Seconds per (schedule, operating mode), per vehicle. Three clauses: the schedule, the vehicle's own source type and road type, and the operating MODE, which gives the 60-wide mode axis its own gate rather than a filter over the cross product."
        },
