          "description": "The prefix count ZEROED on non-members, so every surviving candidate has a dense 1..125 and every suppressed one has a 0 that no output ordinal can match (docs/esm-conventions.md §22). This is what keeps WHICH cohorts survive out of the document: the output row joins to this rank and reads its keys back through the join."
