        {
          "_comment": "J39, and it is `BaseRateCalculator`'s own join: keep the rate rows whose road type the RunSpec selected. Written as a join.on against the selection relation rather than as a test on a constant (docs/esm-conventions.md 20.4), which is also what makes it count road types rather than compare one.",
          "lhs": "rspp_occursOnSelectedRoad",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "faq",
            "args": [],
