        {
          "_comment": "A pollutant-process the RunSpec selects, that happens on a selected road type, and that the rate table covers. `expand-criteria` is the run that separates the last two: SO2 running exhaust passes the road-type test and has no rate row anywhere, so MOVES emits three blocks where the road-type test alone counts four.",
          "lhs": "rspp_isEmitted",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "*",
            "args": [
              "rspp_occursOnSelectedRoad",
              "rspp_hasRatedRow"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "_comment": "`x <= p` is a range predicate over two ranges of one index set, so it is a filter and needs no join gate -- the same shape as `coh_prefixSelected`.",
          "lhs": "rspp_emittedPrefix",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "faq",
            "args": [],
