        {
          "_comment": "THE NINE COEFFICIENT SETS the 135 rows above point at, one per (fuel type, pollutant-process). The exponent depends on nothing else -- not on the source type and not on the model-year range -- so carrying it here rather than on the 135-row relation is a 15-fold reduction in what has to be written down and in what has to be evaluated. The three diesel sets are all-zero: a diesel row selects the biodiesel form and its exponent is never read, but it has to EXIST, because the gather below joins on (fuel type, pollutant-process) and a missing right-hand row would contract to 0 rather than to nothing.",
