        {
          "_comment": "J60: the county's FUEL region. The `run_rows` range is not spare -- it is what lets `run_fuelYearID` resolve as the right side of the second key pair, and a `join.on` pair whose right side names a column over an unranged axis is dropped SILENTLY (EarthSciML/EarthSciAST#437). Without it this gather would sum the county's region over every fuel year it has ever belonged to. The filter is the other half: `regionCodeID` 1 is the onroad refinery supply and 2 the nonroad one, and every county carries both rows.",
