        {
          "_comment": "CO's sulfur alias lives here and nowhere else: `doCOCalculations` evaluates the polynomial with the TARGET fuel's sulfur replaced by the BASE fuel's, so that the sulfur model below is the only place sulfur enters CO's ratio. NOx and THC carry it twice on purpose.",
