          "_comment": "The `has` flag is over the TERM axis alone and the value is over five; a prefix broadcast would align them and this is not a prefix, so the selection is spelled inside a `faq` with explicit `index`es. Written as an elementwise `ifelse` it produces an EMPTY relation rather than an error, and everything downstream of it is then 0 -- which reads as a modelling result and is not one."
