        {
          "_comment": "J71: `setFuelModelWtFactorVariables` queries model-year group 19502000 and falls back to the uniform group 0. The fallback is not a safety net here, it is the ordinary path for two of the three engines: measured, `fuelModelWtFactor` carries 410 rows at 19502000 for the ten CO fuel models and NONE for the nine predictive ones, which take 369 rows at group 0.",
