          "_comment": "The `run_rows` range carries no index in the expression and is NOT spare: it is what lets the second key pair's right side -- `run_humidityEqCFR86`, a one-row relation over `run_rows` -- resolve to a loop symbol at all. Dropping it does not raise; the pair is silently ignored and BOTH arms fire for every fuel type (EarthSciAST #437)."
