              ]
            }
          },
          "_comment": "S15's tail, in `baseratecalculator/adjust.rs`'s own order: the criteria fuel-effect ratio (:477-493) -- which scales `meanBaseRate` and `meanBaseRateACAdj` alike, so one factor over the sum is the same number -- then the temperature factor (:495-535) and the A/C addition (:536-568) are the parenthesised sum -- the temperature step scales the A/C term too, so one factor over the sum is the same number -- then J56's model-year factor (:586-603), then the EV efficiency divisor (:611-616). J56 is the LAST of those to be ported and the only one no fixture could see: its table is keyed on the regulatory class as well as the source type, and until `expand-sourcetype` every cohort in this tree missed it."
        },
